              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit tolimu atemar yaunae ŋikilyok daadaŋ ŋulu esitakinito Daniel ka aponi yaunae ŋikilyok ŋulu esitakinito Daniel, ido aponi kimasakinae ikes nadui a ŋiŋatunyo, ikes ka ŋaberu kec ka ŋidwe kec. Ani eriŋa ikes nyedo kwap neni aya ŋiŋatunyo, apotu ŋiŋatunyo kilout ikes tobilibiliyasi ŋakoyo kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
