        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku aŋun, abu Darius kigirak abaruwa neni a ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ ka nakwapin daadaŋ ka ŋuna irworosi ŋaŋajepa ŋuna egelegelya tema neni kec, “Elipi toryamut iyes ekisil! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
