          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atub ayoŋ ŋakiro atemar alotooma akwap ŋina epukat ayoŋ daadaŋ, itemokino ŋituŋa tomarana ka kitopoloosi Akuj a Daniel,",
          "type": "text",
